WEBVTT

1
00:00:03,890 --> 00:00:04,720
What's going on

2
00:00:04,770 --> 00:00:05,930
Zhang Jianguo is dead

3
00:00:05,930 --> 00:00:07,730
The first time I went out to sea, I encountered a typhoon.

4
00:00:07,730 --> 00:00:08,810
It would be strange not to die

5
00:00:08,810 --> 00:00:10,250
Zhang Jianguo is also worried

6
00:00:10,250 --> 00:00:12,930
In the early morning, the old captain kept trying to persuade him not to go to sea, but he just didn't listen.

7
00:00:12,930 --> 00:00:15,730
It's hard to persuade the damn ghost, now he's better and gone.

8
00:00:15,730 --> 00:00:16,930
Leave a whole family behind

9
00:00:16,930 --> 00:00:19,250
But what happened to you?

10
00:00:19,250 --> 00:00:20,530
Zhang Jianguo is gone

11
00:00:20,530 --> 00:00:23,250
His three ex-wives should be worried this time, you think?

12
00:00:23,250 --> 00:00:24,810
Who will remarry first?

13
00:00:24,810 --> 00:00:26,370
Zhang Jianguo is so fed up with it.

14
00:00:26,370 --> 00:00:27,530
Three beautiful women

15
00:00:27,530 --> 00:00:29,690
Follow him wholeheartedly. If I were the same

16
00:00:29,690 --> 00:00:30,970
Zhang Jianguo was still alive before

17
00:00:30,970 --> 00:00:32,610
Those three women are still rebelling against him

18
00:00:32,610 --> 00:00:34,610
Now she is dead at this time

19
00:00:34,610 --> 00:00:35,850
If I go to offer Yin chess

20
00:00:35,850 --> 00:00:37,210
Take advantage of the situation

21
00:00:37,210 --> 00:00:38,970
I am Zhang Jianguo’s second uncle

22
00:00:38,970 --> 00:00:41,090
If the childless Zhang Jianguo of Xixia dies,

23
00:00:41,090 --> 00:00:42,490
According to the rules of Houhai Village

24
00:00:42,490 --> 00:00:43,650
their family's fields

25
00:00:43,650 --> 00:00:44,650
Homestead etc.

26
00:00:44,650 --> 00:00:49,670
It is my son Zhang Jianjun who should succeed my sister-in-law

27
00:00:49,670 --> 00:00:51,350
Jianguo, this kid is disobedient.

28
00:00:51,350 --> 00:00:52,950
In the morning I kept trying to persuade him not to go to sea.

29
00:00:52,950 --> 00:00:54,430
The bow of the old boat has been at sea for a lifetime

30
00:00:54,430 --> 00:00:55,670
He even sent out warnings about danger

31
00:00:55,670 --> 00:00:57,390
But Jianguo, this kid, is not sensible.

32
00:00:57,390 --> 00:00:58,550
But don't worry

33
00:00:58,550 --> 00:01:00,110
Can't write two chapters in one stroke

34
00:01:00,110 --> 00:01:01,190
As long as your family follows the rules

35
00:01:01,190 --> 00:01:02,710
Change the title deed to Jianjun's name

36
00:01:02,710 --> 00:01:03,990
All property is given to our family

37
00:01:03,990 --> 00:01:05,110
Wait until you die in the future

38
00:01:05,110 --> 00:01:06,710
Jianjun will give you a pension for your retirement

39
00:01:06,710 --> 00:01:07,750
Yes, auntie

40
00:01:07,750 --> 00:01:09,470
As long as you give me what you should give me

41
00:01:09,470 --> 00:01:10,950
For the sake of us being a family

42
00:01:10,950 --> 00:01:12,630
I won't care about what happens behind you

43
00:01:12,630 --> 00:01:13,710
Wait until I get the title deed

44
00:01:13,710 --> 00:01:15,230
Just take Zhang Jianguo’s three ex-wives

45
00:01:15,230 --> 00:01:17,030
Even she and her three little ones got married off after losing money.

46
00:01:17,030 --> 00:01:18,390
A woman receives a financial gift

47
00:01:18,390 --> 00:01:19,950
Three women means three portions

48
00:01:19,950 --> 00:01:21,550
As for the issue of aunt’s pension

49
00:01:21,550 --> 00:01:23,230
What I promise is to take care of my affairs

50
00:01:23,230 --> 00:01:24,950
Making money has nothing to do with me

51
00:01:24,950 --> 00:01:26,150
Second Uncle Jianjun

52
00:01:26,150 --> 00:01:27,310
Jianguo just went to sea and never came back

53
00:01:27,310 --> 00:01:29,510
I didn’t say something must have happened. You should run out now.

54
00:01:29,510 --> 00:01:30,550
I want to split our family and start production

55
00:01:30,550 --> 00:01:32,470
It's too ugly to be so shameless, right?
